  ->  Project  𝄀
        ->  Table Scan on vector_scalar_query.query_vectors  𝄀
              Filter Cond: (query_vectors.id = 'q')  𝄀
  ->  Project  𝄀
        ->  Sort  𝄀
              Sort Key: mo_ivf_alias_0.score INTERNAL  𝄀
              Limit: 2  𝄀
              ->  Table Function on ivf_search  𝄀
                    Index Reader Param:  Limit: 2  𝄀
                    Limit: 2  𝄀
                    ->  Scalar Vector Source  𝄀
  ->  Project  𝄀
        ->  Sort  𝄀
              Sort Key: l2_distance(items.v, #[0,2]) INTERNAL  𝄀
              Limit: 2  𝄀
              ->  Join  𝄀
                    Join Type: SINGLE  𝄀
                    ->  Table Scan on vector_scalar_query.items  𝄀
                    ->  Scalar Vector Source
explain select id from items order by l2_distance(v,(select v from query_vectors where id='q')) limit 2;
